        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-02-13T17:52:07.096Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s a For The Want of A Nail type of story. everything is set up for Paul to die… but Felicia does, instead. I imagine that somehow finding that out (Oracle of Discord, maybe?), finding out that he was supposed to die instead of his daughter, is what finally breaks him.</p>",
